
===== FABRY
  @'Fabry disease': Migalastat -indication-> 'lysosomal lipid storage disorder' in VALID  (shares 1: ['sphingolipidosis'])

===== GAUCHER
  @'Gaucher disease': Miglustat -indication-> 'Niemann-Pick disease' in TRAIN  (shares 4: ['lysosomal disease with epilepsy', 'neurometabolic disease', 'secondary interstitial lung disease specific to childhood associated with a metabolic disease', 'sphingolipidosis'])

